<section class="section page-intro">
  <h1>Platform terms</h1>
  <p>Seedexchange provides directory, exchange and marketplace infrastructure. Organizations remain responsible for their listings, provenance and legal ability to distribute plant material.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Cross-border responsibility</h2>
  <p>Sellers are responsible for export requirements and buyers for import requirements, restrictions and permits in the destination country.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Moderation and protection</h2>
  <p>The platform may reject, hide or suspend organizations, products and listings. Delivery cases pause protected transfers while evidence is reviewed.</p>
</section>
